  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@value" : "Operating reserve requirement in MW where operating reserve is the generating capability that is fully available within 30 minutes. Operating reserve is composed of primary reserve t less than 10 min and secondary reserve 10 less than t less than 30 min."
