  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@value" : "This attribute is used to specify if a bid includes a self sched bid. If so what self sched type is it. The possible values are shown as follow but not limited toETC  Existing transmission contractTOR  Transmission ownership rightRMR  Reliability must runRGMR  Regulatory must runRMT  Relaiability must takePT  Price takerLPT  Low price takerSP  Self provisionRA  Resource adequacyThis attribute is originally defined in the BidSelfSched class"
