  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@value" : "It is possible for a meter to be outfitted with an external VT andor CT. The meter might not be aware of these devices and the display not compensate for their presence. Ultimately when these scalars are applied the value that represents the service value is called the primary metered value. The index in subcategory 3 mirrors those of subcategory 0."
  } ],
