    "@value" : "Resistance from terminal sequence 2 to terminal sequence 1 .Used for steady state power flow. This attribute is optional and represent unbalanced network such as offnominal phase shifter. If only EquivalentBranch.r is given then EquivalentBranch.r21 is assumed equal to EquivalentBranch.r.Usage rule  EquivalentBranch is a result of network reduction prior to the data exchange."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
