    "@value" : "Zero sequence series resistance from terminal sequence  1 to terminal sequence 2. Used for short circuit data exchange according to IEC 60909.EquivalentBranch is a result of network reduction prior to the data exchange."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
