    "@value" : "Fujita scale referred to as EFscale starting in 2007 for tornado damage.  A set of wind estimates not measurements based on damage. It uses threesecond gusts estimated at the point of damage based on a judgment of 8 levels of damage to 28 indicators. These estimates vary with height and exposure.  The 3 second gust is not the same wind as in standard surface observations.Enumerations based on NOAA conventions."
