  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@value" : "Relationship between unit efficiency as percentage and unit output active power for a given net head in meters. The relationship between efficiency discharge head and power output is expressed as follows   E KPHQwhere  E is the efficiency as a percentage P is the active power H is the height Q is the discharge volumetime unit K is a constant.For example a curve instance for a given net head could show efficiency Yaxis versus active power output Xaxis or versus discharge on the Xaxis."
  } ],
