  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@value" : "The default method by which interchange schedules are to be integrated to obtain hourly MWh schedules for accounting. Method 1 is to integrate the instantaneous schedule between the hourly boundaries. Method 2 compensates for any updown ramping that occurs across the hourly boundary this is called block accounting."
