    "@value" : "Change in the disturbance   storm time Dst index. The size of a geomagnetic storm is classified as moderate  50 nT gtminimum of Dst gt 100 nT intense 100 nT gt minimum Dst gt 250 nT or  superstorm  minimum of Dst lt 250 nT."
  } ],
