  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@value" : "Category of this person relative to utility operations classified according to the utilitys corporate standards and practices. Examples include employee contractor agent not affiliated etc.This field is not used to indicate whether this person is a customer of the utility. Often an employee or contractor is also a customer. Customer information is gained with relationship to Organisation and CustomerData. In similar fashion this field does not indicate the various roles this person may fill as part of utility operations."
  } ],
