    "@value" : "Describes the status and the planned implementation of the associated change set into the asbuilt model.    New instances of this class with new identity are instantiated upon changes to the content of this class or changes to the associated change set.  Instances of this class are considered immutable.  The case audit trail can reference this immutable data to exactly reproduce a case."
  } ],
