  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@value" : "IEEE PF controller type 2 which is a summing point type controller making up the outside loop of a twoloop system. This controller is implemented as a slow PI type controller. The voltage regulator forms the inner loop and is implemented as a fast controller.Reference IEEE 421.52005 11.4. "
  } ],
