    "@value" : "A schedule of charges structure associated with Tariff that allows the definition of complex tarif structures such as step and time of use when used in conjunction with TimeTariffInterval and Charge. Inherited status.value is defined in the context of the utilitys business rules for example active inactive etc."
  } ],
