    "@id" : "http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#UnitSymbol"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@value" : "Relative temperature in degrees Celsius.In the SI unit system the symbol is C. Electric charge is measured in coulomb that has the unit symbol C. To distinguish degree Celsius from coulomb the symbol used in the UML is degC. The reason for not using C is that the special character  is difficult to manage in software."
  } ],
