    "@value" : "font color0f0f0fTerminal voltage transducer and load compensator as defined in IEEE 421.52005 4. This model is common to all excitation system models described in the IEEE Standard. fontfont color0f0f0fParameter detailsfontollifont color0f0f0fIf iRci and iXci are set to zero the lfontoad compensation is not employed and the behaviour is as a simple sensing circuit.liololliIf all parameters iRci iXci and iTri are set to zero the standard model VCompIEEEType1 is bypassed.liolReference IEEE 421.52005 4. "
  } ],
