    "@value" : "The reactance depend on the tap position according to a u shaped curve. The minimum reactance xMin appear at the mid tap position.   PowerTransformerEnd.x shall be consistent with PhaseTapChangerLinear.xMin and PhaseTapChangerNonLinear.xMin. In case of inconsistency PowerTransformerEnd.x shall be used."
  }, {
    "@value" : "The reactance depends on the tap position according to a u shaped curve. The minimum reactance xMin appears at the mid tap position.  PowerTransformerEnd.x shall be consistent with PhaseTapChangerLinear.xMin and PhaseTapChangerNonLinear.xMin. In case of inconsistency PowerTransformerEnd.x shall be used."
  } ],
